### Passo 1: Criar CSS Unificado

Criar um arquivo `design-system.css` com todo o CSS do `index.html`, incluindo:

```css
/* design-system.css - Design System NovaSync */

:root {
  /* Variáveis de cores */
  --bg: oklch(0.10 0.025 300);
  --surface: oklch(0.14 0.030 300);
  --fg: oklch(0.97 0.012 300);
  --muted: oklch(0.75 0.030 300);
  --border: oklch(0.36 0.045 300);
  --accent: #2a2a46;
  --accent-gradient: #2f2f39;
  --accent-readable: oklch(0.82 0.08 260);

  /* Variáveis de layout */
  --shell-width: min(1120px, calc(100% - 48px));
  --section-padding: 104px;
}

/* Reset e base */
* { box-sizing: border-box; }
html { scroll-behavior: smooth; background: var(--bg); }
body { 
  position: relative; 
  isolation: isolate; 
  margin: 0; 
  background: transparent; 
  color: var(--fg); 
  font-family: Manrope, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif; 
  font-size: 16px; 
}

/* Background animado */
body::before {
  content: "";
  position: fixed;
  z-index: -1;
  inset: -18%;
  pointer-events: none;
  background:
    radial-gradient(ellipse 42% 30% at 12% 18%, color-mix(in oklab, var(--accent-gradient), transparent 34%), transparent 72%),
    radial-gradient(ellipse 36% 27% at 84% 42%, color-mix(in oklab, var(--accent), transparent 46%), transparent 72%),
    radial-gradient(ellipse 48% 31% at 52% 88%, color-mix(in oklab, var(--accent-readable), transparent 89%), transparent 76%);
  background-size: 138% 138%, 132% 132%, 145% 145%;
  background-position: 0% 48%, 100% 42%, 50% 100%;
  filter: blur(30px);
  opacity: .72;
  animation: site-wave-drift 19s ease-in-out infinite alternate;
}

@keyframes site-wave-drift {
  0% { background-position: 0% 48%, 100% 42%, 50% 100%; transform: scale(1); }
  50% { background-position: 34% 28%, 68% 64%, 26% 76%; transform: scale(1.055); }
  100% { background-position: 100% 56%, 8% 34%, 74% 18%; transform: scale(1.02); }
}

/* Container */
.shell { width: var(--shell-width); margin: 0 auto; }

/* Header */
.topbar {
  width: 100%;
  max-width: none;
  margin: 0;
  padding-inline: max(24px, calc((100% - 1120px) / 2));
  min-height: 88px;
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr auto 1fr;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 20px;
  background: linear-gradient(to bottom, #11111F 0%, rgba(17, 17, 31, .72) 38%, rgba(17, 17, 31, .24) 72%, transparent 100%);
}

/* ... resto do CSS do index.html ... */

/* Media Queries Padronizadas */
@media (max-width: 820px) {
  .nav { display: none; }
  .topbar { grid-template-columns: 44px 1fr 44px; }
  .brand { grid-column: 2; justify-self: center; }
  .nav-cta { display: none; }
  /* ... etc ... */
}

@media (max-width: 540px) {
  .shell { width: min(100% - 32px, 1120px); }
  /* ... etc ... */
}
```

